{"id":10368,"author":"toketrain","body":"Hello, I've created some references for making various letters and numbers.\u003cbr\u003eSo far in this thread, there's 3x3 letters, 3x3 numbers, and anvil letters.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e3x3 letters:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/2VLacol.png\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/qhbOJnk.png\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/3bBjV#0\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eview closeups\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cbr\u003e3x3 numbers:\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/23pQNSR.png\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/GVLNc#0\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eview closeups\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003eanvil letters (these are quite odd):\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/NqP5bZH.png\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/GYdcX#0\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eview closeups\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ei've used the 3x3 letters/numbers in several builds, so this reference might help someone. i used stone bricks because i thought it'd be easier to see. have a good weekend avicus :)\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003c/i\u003e","body_tagged":"Hello, I've created some references for making various letters and numbers.\u003cbr\u003eSo far in this thread, there's 3x3 letters, 3x3 numbers, and anvil letters.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e3x3 letters:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/2VLacol.png\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/qhbOJnk.png\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/3bBjV#0\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eview closeups\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cbr\u003e3x3 numbers:\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/23pQNSR.png\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/GVLNc#0\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eview closeups\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003eanvil letters (these are quite odd):\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/NqP5bZH.png\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/GYdcX#0\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eview closeups\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ei've used the 3x3 letters/numbers in several builds, so this reference might help someone. i used stone bricks because i thought it'd be easier to see. have a good weekend avicus :)\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003c/i\u003e","created_at":1421534690,"title":"Building Reference- Letters/Numbers","replies":[{"id":140468,"author":"Mooch24","body":"thats actually so cool","body_tagged":"thats actually so cool","created_at":1421534970},{"id":140470,"author":"MLGtino","body":"ty","body_tagged":"ty","created_at":1421534980},{"id":140527,"author":"kycrafft","body":"Pretty useful!","body_tagged":"Pretty useful!","created_at":1421537761}]}